    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000syt5](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000syt5) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 62.684 depth occurred on May 19 2026 16km SE of Rosario De Yauca. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -14.2425 longitude -75.4795. It impacted 326943 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
